sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    title END-TO-END - From App Launch to Audio Narration

    actor User
    participant App as MAUI App
    participant Pref as Preferences
    participant DB as Supabase
    participant PlaceService
    participant Loc as LocationService
    participant Geo as GeofenceEngine
    participant TTS as NarrationService

    User->>App: Launch app
    App->>Pref: Read DeviceId, SessionId, ExpiresAt
    Pref-->>App: Return session data

    Note over App: Check if session is valid
    App->>App: Compare ExpiresAt with now

    rect rgba(144, 238, 144, 0.2)
        Note over App: Session is valid - continue
        App->>PlaceService: Load places with TTS contents
        PlaceService->>DB: GET places WHERE IsActive AND IsApproved
        DB-->>PlaceService: Return places + images + TTS data
        PlaceService->>PlaceService: Cache in RAM memory
        PlaceService-->>App: Places ready
        
        User->>App: Open Map Tab
        App->>Loc: Register LocationChanged listener
        App->>Loc: Start GPS tracking

        loop Every GPS Location Update
            Loc->>Loc: Emit LocationChanged event
            Loc->>App: Update user marker on map
            Loc->>Geo: Send current coordinates

            Geo->>Geo: Filter places with TTS script
            Geo->>Geo: Filter by radius (default 50m)
            Geo->>Geo: Filter by cooldown status
            Geo->>Geo: Sort by Priority DESC, Distance ASC
            Geo->>Geo: Apply 2-second debounce

            Note over Geo: Debounce satisfied - POI found
            Geo->>TTS: Get narration script for locale
            TTS-->>Geo: Return TTS text
            Geo->>TTS: Call SpeakAsync(script, locale)
            TTS-->>User: Play audio narration

            Geo->>Geo: Update place.LastPlayedAt
            Geo->>App: Return POI to MapPage
        end
    end

    rect rgba(255, 99, 71, 0.2)
        Note over App: Session expired or invalid
        App->>Pref: Clear session data
        App->>App: Navigate to SubscriptionPage
    end
